{"page":289,"verses":[{"verse_key":"17:67","surah":17,"ayah":67,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا مَسَّكُمُ ٱلضُّرُّ فِى ٱلْبَحْرِ ضَلَّ مَن تَدْعُونَ إِلَّآ إِيَّاهُ ۖ فَلَمَّا نَجَّىٰكُمْ إِلَى ٱلْبَرِّ أَعْرَضْتُمْ ۚ وَكَانَ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ كَفُورًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When you get into distress at sea, those you pray to besides Him desert you, but when He brings you back safe to land you turn away: man is ever ungrateful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"17:67"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَسَّكُمُ","en_gloss":"touches you","transliteration":"massakumu","verse_key":"17:67"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلضُّرُّ","en_gloss":"the hardship","transliteration":"l-ḍuru","verse_key":"17:67"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"17:67"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْبَحْرِ","en_gloss":"the sea","transliteration":"l-baḥri","verse_key":"17:67"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ضَلَّ","en_gloss":"lost","transliteration":"ḍalla","verse_key":"17:67"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"(are) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"17:67"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَدْعُونَ","en_gloss":"you call","transliteration":"tadʿūna","verse_key":"17:67"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَّآ","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"17:67"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِيَّاهُ ۖ","en_gloss":"Him Alone","transliteration":"iyyāhu","verse_key":"17:67"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"But when","transliteration":"falammā","verse_key":"17:67"},{"pos":12,"ar":"نَجَّىٰكُمْ","en_gloss":"He delivers you","transliteration":"najjākum","verse_key":"17:67"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"17:67"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْبَرِّ","en_gloss":"the land","transliteration":"l-bari","verse_key":"17:67"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أَعْرَضْتُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"you turn away","transliteration":"aʿraḍtum","verse_key":"17:67"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَكَانَ","en_gloss":"And is","transliteration":"wakāna","verse_key":"17:67"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","en_gloss":"man","transliteration":"l-insānu","verse_key":"17:67"},{"pos":18,"ar":"كَفُورًا","en_gloss":"ungrateful","transliteration":"kafūran","verse_key":"17:67"},{"pos":19,"ar":"٦٧","en_gloss":"(67)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:67"}]},{"verse_key":"17:68","surah":17,"ayah":68,"ar_uthmani":"أَفَأَمِنتُمْ أَن يَخْسِفَ بِكُمْ جَانِبَ ٱلْبَرِّ أَوْ يُرْسِلَ عَلَيْكُمْ حَاصِبًا ثُمَّ لَا تَجِدُوا۟ لَكُمْ وَكِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Can you be sure that God will not have you swallowed up into the earth when you are back on land, or that He will not send a sandstorm against you? Then you will find no one to protect you.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَفَأَمِنتُمْ","en_gloss":"Do you then feel secure","transliteration":"afa-amintum","verse_key":"17:68"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that (not)","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"17:68"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَخْسِفَ","en_gloss":"He will cause to swallow","transliteration":"yakhsifa","verse_key":"17:68"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِكُمْ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"bikum","verse_key":"17:68"},{"pos":5,"ar":"جَانِبَ","en_gloss":"side","transliteration":"jāniba","verse_key":"17:68"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْبَرِّ","en_gloss":"(of) the land","transliteration":"l-bari","verse_key":"17:68"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"17:68"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يُرْسِلَ","en_gloss":"send","transliteration":"yur'sila","verse_key":"17:68"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"against you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"17:68"},{"pos":10,"ar":"حَاصِبًۭا","en_gloss":"a storm of stones","transliteration":"ḥāṣiban","verse_key":"17:68"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"17:68"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"17:68"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَجِدُوا۟","en_gloss":"you will find","transliteration":"tajidū","verse_key":"17:68"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"17:68"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَكِيلًا","en_gloss":"a guardian","transliteration":"wakīlan","verse_key":"17:68"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٦٨","en_gloss":"(68)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:68"}]},{"verse_key":"17:69","surah":17,"ayah":69,"ar_uthmani":"أَمْ أَمِنتُمْ أَن يُعِيدَكُمْ فِيهِ تَارَةً أُخْرَىٰ فَيُرْسِلَ عَلَيْكُمْ قَاصِفًا مِّنَ ٱلرِّيحِ فَيُغْرِقَكُم بِمَا كَفَرْتُمْ ۙ ثُمَّ لَا تَجِدُوا۟ لَكُمْ عَلَيْنَا بِهِۦ تَبِيعًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Or can you be sure that He will not send you back out to sea, and send a violent storm against you to drown you for being so ungrateful? You will find no helper against Us there.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمْ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"17:69"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَمِنتُمْ","en_gloss":"do you feel secure","transliteration":"amintum","verse_key":"17:69"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that (not)","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"17:69"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُعِيدَكُمْ","en_gloss":"He will send you back","transliteration":"yuʿīdakum","verse_key":"17:69"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"into it","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"17:69"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَارَةً","en_gloss":"another time","transliteration":"tāratan","verse_key":"17:69"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أُخْرَىٰ","en_gloss":"another time","transliteration":"ukh'rā","verse_key":"17:69"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَيُرْسِلَ","en_gloss":"and send","transliteration":"fayur'sila","verse_key":"17:69"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"upon you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"17:69"},{"pos":10,"ar":"قَاصِفًۭا","en_gloss":"a hurricane","transliteration":"qāṣifan","verse_key":"17:69"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"17:69"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلرِّيحِ","en_gloss":"the wind","transliteration":"l-rīḥi","verse_key":"17:69"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَيُغْرِقَكُم","en_gloss":"and drown you","transliteration":"fayugh'riqakum","verse_key":"17:69"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"because","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"17:69"},{"pos":15,"ar":"كَفَرْتُمْ ۙ","en_gloss":"you disbelieved","transliteration":"kafartum","verse_key":"17:69"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"17:69"},{"pos":17,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"17:69"},{"pos":18,"ar":"تَجِدُوا۟","en_gloss":"you will find","transliteration":"tajidū","verse_key":"17:69"},{"pos":19,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"17:69"},{"pos":20,"ar":"عَلَيْنَا","en_gloss":"against Us","transliteration":"ʿalaynā","verse_key":"17:69"},{"pos":21,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"17:69"},{"pos":22,"ar":"تَبِيعًۭا","en_gloss":"an avenger","transliteration":"tabīʿan","verse_key":"17:69"},{"pos":23,"ar":"٦٩","en_gloss":"(69)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:69"}]},{"verse_key":"17:70","surah":17,"ayah":70,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَلَقَدْ كَرَّمْنَا بَنِىٓ ءَادَمَ وَحَمَلْنَـٰهُمْ فِى ٱلْبَرِّ وَٱلْبَحْرِ وَرَزَقْنَـٰهُم مِّنَ ٱلطَّيِّبَـٰتِ وَفَضَّلْنَـٰهُمْ عَلَىٰ كَثِيرٍ مِّمَّنْ خَلَقْنَا تَفْضِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have honoured the children of Adam and carried them by land and sea; We have provided good sustenance for them and favoured them specially above many of those We have created.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And certainly","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"17:70"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَرَّمْنَا","en_gloss":"We have honored","transliteration":"karramnā","verse_key":"17:70"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بَنِىٓ","en_gloss":"(the) children of Adam","transliteration":"banī","verse_key":"17:70"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ءَادَمَ","en_gloss":"(the) children of Adam","transliteration":"ādama","verse_key":"17:70"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَحَمَلْنَـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"and We carried them","transliteration":"waḥamalnāhum","verse_key":"17:70"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"17:70"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْبَرِّ","en_gloss":"the land","transliteration":"l-bari","verse_key":"17:70"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱلْبَحْرِ","en_gloss":"and the sea","transliteration":"wal-baḥri","verse_key":"17:70"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَرَزَقْنَـٰهُم","en_gloss":"and We have provided them","transliteration":"warazaqnāhum","verse_key":"17:70"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"17:70"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلطَّيِّبَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the good things","transliteration":"l-ṭayibāti","verse_key":"17:70"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَفَضَّلْنَـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"and We preferred them","transliteration":"wafaḍḍalnāhum","verse_key":"17:70"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"17:70"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كَثِيرٍۢ","en_gloss":"many","transliteration":"kathīrin","verse_key":"17:70"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِّمَّنْ","en_gloss":"of those whom","transliteration":"mimman","verse_key":"17:70"},{"pos":16,"ar":"خَلَقْنَا","en_gloss":"We have created","transliteration":"khalaqnā","verse_key":"17:70"},{"pos":17,"ar":"تَفْضِيلًۭا","en_gloss":"(with) preference","transliteration":"tafḍīlan","verse_key":"17:70"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٧٠","en_gloss":"(70)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:70"}]},{"verse_key":"17:71","surah":17,"ayah":71,"ar_uthmani":"يَوْمَ نَدْعُوا۟ كُلَّ أُنَاسٍۭ بِإِمَـٰمِهِمْ ۖ فَمَنْ أُوتِىَ كِتَـٰبَهُۥ بِيَمِينِهِۦ فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ يَقْرَءُونَ كِتَـٰبَهُمْ وَلَا يُظْلَمُونَ فَتِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"On the Day when We summon each community, along with its leader, those who are given their record in their right hand will read it [with pleasure]. But no one will be wronged in the least:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(The) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"17:71"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَدْعُوا۟","en_gloss":"We will call","transliteration":"nadʿū","verse_key":"17:71"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كُلَّ","en_gloss":"all","transliteration":"kulla","verse_key":"17:71"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أُنَاسٍۭ","en_gloss":"human beings","transliteration":"unāsin","verse_key":"17:71"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِإِمَـٰمِهِمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"with their record","transliteration":"bi-imāmihim","verse_key":"17:71"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَمَنْ","en_gloss":"then whoever","transliteration":"faman","verse_key":"17:71"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أُوتِىَ","en_gloss":"is given","transliteration":"ūtiya","verse_key":"17:71"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كِتَـٰبَهُۥ","en_gloss":"his record","transliteration":"kitābahu","verse_key":"17:71"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِيَمِينِهِۦ","en_gloss":"in his right hand","transliteration":"biyamīnihi","verse_key":"17:71"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"then those","transliteration":"fa-ulāika","verse_key":"17:71"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَقْرَءُونَ","en_gloss":"will read","transliteration":"yaqraūna","verse_key":"17:71"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كِتَـٰبَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their records","transliteration":"kitābahum","verse_key":"17:71"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"17:71"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يُظْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"they will be wronged","transliteration":"yuẓ'lamūna","verse_key":"17:71"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَتِيلًۭا","en_gloss":"(even as much as) a hair on a date seed","transliteration":"fatīlan","verse_key":"17:71"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٧١","en_gloss":"(71)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:71"}]},{"verse_key":"17:72","surah":17,"ayah":72,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَن كَانَ فِى هَـٰذِهِۦٓ أَعْمَىٰ فَهُوَ فِى ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ أَعْمَىٰ وَأَضَلُّ سَبِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"those who were blind in this life will be blind in the Hereafter, and even further off the path.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"17:72"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"17:72"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"17:72"},{"pos":4,"ar":"هَـٰذِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"this (world)","transliteration":"hādhihi","verse_key":"17:72"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَعْمَىٰ","en_gloss":"blind","transliteration":"aʿmā","verse_key":"17:72"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَهُوَ","en_gloss":"then he","transliteration":"fahuwa","verse_key":"17:72"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"17:72"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","en_gloss":"the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","verse_key":"17:72"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَعْمَىٰ","en_gloss":"(will be) blind","transliteration":"aʿmā","verse_key":"17:72"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَأَضَلُّ","en_gloss":"and more astray","transliteration":"wa-aḍallu","verse_key":"17:72"},{"pos":11,"ar":"سَبِيلًۭا","en_gloss":"(from the) path","transliteration":"sabīlan","verse_key":"17:72"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٧٢","en_gloss":"(72)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:72"}]},{"verse_key":"17:73","surah":17,"ayah":73,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِن كَادُوا۟ لَيَفْتِنُونَكَ عَنِ ٱلَّذِىٓ أَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَيْكَ لِتَفْتَرِىَ عَلَيْنَا غَيْرَهُۥ ۖ وَإِذًا لَّٱتَّخَذُوكَ خَلِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], the disbelievers tried to tempt you away from what We revealed to you, so that you would invent some other revelation and attribute it to Us and then they would have taken you as a friend.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"17:73"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَادُوا۟","en_gloss":"they were about (to)","transliteration":"kādū","verse_key":"17:73"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَيَفْتِنُونَكَ","en_gloss":"tempt you away","transliteration":"layaftinūnaka","verse_key":"17:73"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَنِ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿani","verse_key":"17:73"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"that which","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"17:73"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَوْحَيْنَآ","en_gloss":"We revealed","transliteration":"awḥaynā","verse_key":"17:73"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"17:73"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لِتَفْتَرِىَ","en_gloss":"that you invent","transliteration":"litaftariya","verse_key":"17:73"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَيْنَا","en_gloss":"about Us","transliteration":"ʿalaynā","verse_key":"17:73"},{"pos":10,"ar":"غَيْرَهُۥ ۖ","en_gloss":"other (than) it","transliteration":"ghayrahu","verse_key":"17:73"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَإِذًۭا","en_gloss":"And then","transliteration":"wa-idhan","verse_key":"17:73"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَّٱتَّخَذُوكَ","en_gloss":"surely they would take you","transliteration":"la-ittakhadhūka","verse_key":"17:73"},{"pos":13,"ar":"خَلِيلًۭا","en_gloss":"(as) a friend","transliteration":"khalīlan","verse_key":"17:73"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٧٣","en_gloss":"(73)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:73"}]},{"verse_key":"17:74","surah":17,"ayah":74,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَوْلَآ أَن ثَبَّتْنَـٰكَ لَقَدْ كِدتَّ تَرْكَنُ إِلَيْهِمْ شَيْـًٔا قَلِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If We had not made you stand firm, you would almost have inclined a little towards them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَوْلَآ","en_gloss":"And if not","transliteration":"walawlā","verse_key":"17:74"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"[that]","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"17:74"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ثَبَّتْنَـٰكَ","en_gloss":"We (had) strengthened you","transliteration":"thabbatnāka","verse_key":"17:74"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَقَدْ","en_gloss":"certainly","transliteration":"laqad","verse_key":"17:74"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كِدتَّ","en_gloss":"you almost","transliteration":"kidtta","verse_key":"17:74"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَرْكَنُ","en_gloss":"(would) have inclined","transliteration":"tarkanu","verse_key":"17:74"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ilayhim","verse_key":"17:74"},{"pos":8,"ar":"شَيْـًۭٔا","en_gloss":"(in) something","transliteration":"shayan","verse_key":"17:74"},{"pos":9,"ar":"قَلِيلًا","en_gloss":"a little","transliteration":"qalīlan","verse_key":"17:74"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٧٤","en_gloss":"(74)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:74"}]},{"verse_key":"17:75","surah":17,"ayah":75,"ar_uthmani":"إِذًا لَّأَذَقْنَـٰكَ ضِعْفَ ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ وَضِعْفَ ٱلْمَمَاتِ ثُمَّ لَا تَجِدُ لَكَ عَلَيْنَا نَصِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"In that case, We would have made you taste a double punishment in this life, and a double punishment after death and then you would have found no one to help you against Us.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِذًۭا","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"idhan","verse_key":"17:75"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَّأَذَقْنَـٰكَ","en_gloss":"We (would) have made you taste","transliteration":"la-adhaqnāka","verse_key":"17:75"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ضِعْفَ","en_gloss":"double","transliteration":"ḍiʿ'fa","verse_key":"17:75"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"(in) the life","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","verse_key":"17:75"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَضِعْفَ","en_gloss":"and double","transliteration":"waḍiʿ'fa","verse_key":"17:75"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْمَمَاتِ","en_gloss":"(after) the death","transliteration":"l-mamāti","verse_key":"17:75"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"17:75"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"17:75"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَجِدُ","en_gloss":"you (would) have found","transliteration":"tajidu","verse_key":"17:75"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَكَ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"laka","verse_key":"17:75"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَلَيْنَا","en_gloss":"against Us","transliteration":"ʿalaynā","verse_key":"17:75"},{"pos":12,"ar":"نَصِيرًۭا","en_gloss":"any helper","transliteration":"naṣīran","verse_key":"17:75"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٧٥","en_gloss":"(75)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:75"}]}]}